{"version":1,"content":"<p>可以説，AMD目前的桌面遊戲GPU市場表現相當不錯。儘管目前還沒有旗艦級的RDNA 4 GPU，而且AMD的一些定價策略也頗具爭議。AMD的業績如此出色，以至於其在亞馬遜上的Radeon GPU銷量首次超過了GeForce顯卡。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585034.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.017807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:09:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.768450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.768450+00:00","content_hash":"062234dca06a67b4c9adf967d0aec9bdf1e7c8200c84375a69fa16c874bbe7a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}